# Charged ollie, Double Impossible (J + up, then J again: THPS 1+2's double tap on that slot, added
# 2026-11-16) right after the pop: the flip finishes and the combo lands (./skate strip --sheet scenarios/flips.strips).
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
tap flip+up 96
tap flip 99
run 300
expect event trickStart{trick=Double Impossible} within 100..100
expect event trickEnd{trick=Double Impossible} within 120..180
expect event comboLanded{name=Double Impossible,points=450} within 160..240
expect no event bail
